9
01:23:04,615 --> 01:23:10,615
The Magic of Ordinary Days is a Hallmark Hall of Fame production based on a novel of the
same name by Ann Howard Creel and adapted as a teleplay by Camille Thomasson.

10
01:32:18,461 --> 01:32:24,461
It was directed by Brent Shields, produced by Andrew Gottlieb and
stars Keri Russell, Skeet Ulrich, and Mare Winningham.

11
01:41:32,307 --> 01:41:38,307
The film first aired on CBS on January 30, 2005, and received an encore
broadcast on the same network exactly five years later.

